/* Simplified Chinese strings that only the Windows version uses. Keys are the English source strings. */

"Already used by another app: %@" = "已被其他软件占用：%@";
"Audio enhancements are off for %@" = "%@ 的“音频增强”已关闭";
"Audio processing by Equalizer APO by Jonas Thedering (GPL)." = "音频处理由 Jonas Thedering 开发的 Equalizer APO 完成（GPL）。";
"Check Again" = "重新检测";
"Choose the devices Equalizer APO runs on. Needs administrator rights and a restart of the device." = "选择 Equalizer APO 要作用的设备。需要管理员权限，并需重启该设备。";
"Clipping: lower the preamp" = "出现削波：请降低预增益";
"Crossfeed, balance and width switch together with the curve." = "交叉馈送、平衡和声场宽度会跟着曲线一起切换。";
"Download Equalizer APO" = "下载 Equalizer APO";
"Drag to move · Scroll for Q · Alt-click to delete · Double-click empty space to add" = "拖动移动 · 滚轮调 Q 值 · Alt 点按删除 · 双击空白处添加";
"Enhancements off" = "音频增强已关";
"Equalizer APO" = "Equalizer APO";
"Equalizer APO has no limiter, so the simulation plays %.1f dB below the loudness of your sound so that it cannot clip." = "Equalizer APO 没有限幅器，所以模拟会比你原本的响度低 %.1f dB，以免削波。";
"Equalizer APO has no limiter. Keep the preamp on Auto so boosts don't clip, and lower this if the meters reach the top." = "Equalizer APO 没有限幅器。请把预增益保持在“自动”，避免提升频段时破音；电平表顶满时调低这里。";
"Equalizer APO is not installed on %@" = "%@ 上没有安装 Equalizer APO";
"Equalizer APO is not installed on this device. Open its Configurator to add it." = "这个设备上没有安装 Equalizer APO。打开它的 Configurator 添加即可。";
"Equalizer APO keeps applying your EQ while Tapline is closed. Turn this off to hear the original sound." = "关闭 Tapline 后 Equalizer APO 仍会继续应用你的 EQ。关掉这一项即可听到原声。";
"Fix Permissions" = "修复权限";
"Fixing the folder permissions needs administrator rights once." = "修复文件夹权限需要一次管理员授权。";
"In the Tapline window: Ctrl+Z undo, Ctrl+Y redo, Ctrl+B bypass EQ, Ctrl+K compare A/B." = "在 Tapline 窗口中：Ctrl+Z 撤销，Ctrl+Y 重做，Ctrl+B 旁通 EQ，Ctrl+K A/B 对比。";
"Installed · configuration in %@" = "已安装 · 配置文件位于 %@";
"Keep Tapline in the notification area when the window is closed" = "关闭窗口后让 Tapline 留在通知区域（托盘）";
"Needs Equalizer APO" = "需要 Equalizer APO";
"No Equalizer APO" = "未装 Equalizer APO";
"Not installed" = "未安装";
"Not on this device" = "未作用于此设备";
"On Windows, Tapline uses the free, open-source Equalizer APO as its audio engine. Install it, tick your output devices in the Configurator that opens at the end, and restart Windows." = "在 Windows 上，Tapline 使用免费开源的 Equalizer APO 作为音频引擎。请安装它，在安装结束时弹出的 Configurator 中勾选你的输出设备，然后重启 Windows。";
"Open Configurator" = "打开 Configurator";
"Open Equalizer APO's Configurator, tick this device, and restart Windows (or the device). Until then this output plays without Tapline." = "打开 Equalizer APO 的 Configurator，勾选这个设备，然后重启 Windows（或该设备）。在此之前，这个输出设备的声音不会经过 Tapline。";
"Open Sound Settings" = "打开声音设置";
"Open-source system-wide EQ, headphone and room correction for Windows, built on Equalizer APO." = "开源的 Windows 全局 EQ、耳机校正与房间校正工具，基于 Equalizer APO。";
"Process audio" = "处理音频";
"Puts back the Equalizer APO configuration Tapline replaced and turns Tapline's processing off." = "恢复被 Tapline 替换掉的 Equalizer APO 配置，并关闭 Tapline 的处理。";
"Redo (Ctrl+Y)" = "重做（Ctrl+Y）";
"Remove all device EQs and presets." = "清除所有设备的 EQ 和预设。";
"Restore" = "恢复";
"Restore Previous Configuration…" = "恢复之前的配置…";
"Show Configuration File" = "显示配置文件";
"System sounds" = "系统声音";
"Tapline %@ for Windows" = "Tapline %@ Windows 版";
"Tapline could not write Equalizer APO's configuration" = "Tapline 无法写入 Equalizer APO 的配置";
"Tapline needs Equalizer APO" = "Tapline 需要 Equalizer APO";
"Tapline saved your own Equalizer APO configuration before it took over." = "Tapline 接管之前已保存你原来的 Equalizer APO 配置。";
"Tapline writes its EQ into Equalizer APO, which processes the sound inside Windows. The EQ keeps working while Tapline is closed; switch processing off to stop it." = "Tapline 把 EQ 写入 Equalizer APO，由它在 Windows 内部处理声音。关闭 Tapline 后 EQ 仍然有效；要停用请关闭处理。";
"The spectrum shows what the output device plays, after the EQ. It is measured on this PC; nothing is recorded or sent anywhere." = "频谱显示输出设备实际播放的声音（EQ 之后）。只在本机分析，不会录音，也不会发送到任何地方。";
"These are Windows' own per-app volumes, the same as in the Volume Mixer, so they stay when Tapline is closed. Apps that use exclusive mode or ASIO, like most music production software, play directly without EQ." = "这里调的是 Windows 自带的各应用音量，和“音量合成器”里的一样，关闭 Tapline 后依然保留。使用独占模式或 ASIO 的软件（例如大多数音乐制作软件）会直接播放，不经过 EQ。";
"Undo (Ctrl+Z)" = "撤销（Ctrl+Z）";
"Windows did not accept the change. Choose the device in the Sound settings instead." = "Windows 没有接受这个更改。请在声音设置中选择设备。";
"Windows then skips Equalizer APO. Turn them on in Settings › System › Sound › the device › Audio enhancements." = "这样 Windows 会跳过 Equalizer APO。请在 设置 › 系统 › 声音 › 该设备 › 音频增强 中打开。";
"Tapline will take over Equalizer APO" = "Tapline 将接管 Equalizer APO";
"Equalizer APO already has a configuration. Tapline replaces it with its own and keeps a copy as %@, which you can restore under Devices › Audio Engine." = "Equalizer APO 已经有一份配置。Tapline 会用自己的配置替换它，并把原配置备份为 %@，之后可以在“设备 › 音频引擎”中恢复。";
"Use Tapline" = "使用 Tapline";
"Import Its EQ as a Preset and Use Tapline" = "把原 EQ 导入为预设，然后使用 Tapline";
"Waiting for your go-ahead" = "等待你确认";
"Previous Equalizer APO configuration" = "原 Equalizer APO 配置";
"Tapline keeps running in the notification area. Right-click its icon to quit." = "Tapline 仍在通知区域（托盘）运行。右键点它的图标可以退出。";
"What you hear when the EQ is switched off (EQ switch, Ctrl+B, Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B, notification area)." = "关掉 EQ 时听到的声音（EQ 开关、Ctrl+B、Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B、通知区域）。";
"WAV files" = "WAV 文件";
